### 1. GET 查詢所有圖片 (包含 static/images/room/ 下的 11 筆資料)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/images
Authorization: Basic vic1 111

### 2. GET 查詢單一圖片 (查詢 ID = 1 的圖片)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/images/1
Authorization: Basic vic1 111

### 3. GET 查詢上傳的貓咪圖片 (查詢 ID = 39 的圖片)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/images/39
Authorization: Basic vic1 111

### 4. POST 上傳新圖片檔案 (Form-Data 格式)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/images
Authorization: Basic vic1 111
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test_room.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test_room.jpg
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="imageDesc"

測試上傳新房型圖片
--WebAppBoundary--

### 5. POST 使用靜態預設路徑新增圖片
POST http://localhost:8081/api/images
Authorization: Basic vic1 111
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

staticPath=/images/room/roomtype.1.jpg&imageDesc=海景標準雙人房(備用)

### 6. PUT 修改圖片描述 (修改 ID = 39 的資料)
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/images/39
Authorization: Basic vic1 111
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "path": "/images/room/835bd85a-1bbf-4f9f-85e5-27f9642e5648_Cat_November_2010-1a.jpg",
  "imageDesc": "可愛貓咪房型封面照(已修改)"
}

### 7. DELETE 刪除圖片 (刪除 ID = 39 的資料並同步刪除實體檔)
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/images/39
Authorization: Basic vic1 111